∶</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">45</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black;"><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">场次11</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black;"><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">17</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">∶</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">15—17</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">∶</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">45</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 25.5pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black;"><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">--</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black;"><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">--</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black;"><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">备用场（22）</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black;"><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">18</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">∶</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">00—18</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">∶</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">30</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 25.5pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black;"><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">--</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black;"><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">--</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black;"><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">备用场（23）</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 1.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black;"><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">18</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">∶</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">45—19</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">∶</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">15</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><br><br><br><p><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">二、报名资格</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">（一）CET报考者应为全日制普通高等院校本科</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">在校生</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">、在籍</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">研究生；</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">修完大学英语四级课程的学生可报考CET4；修完大学英语六级课程且CET4达到425分及以上的学生可报考CET6。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">非在校生不得报名考试。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">（二）</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">CET—SET（口语）报考资格为完成对应级别笔试科目报考的考生，即</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">完成本次CET4笔试报名后可报考CET—SET4，完成本次CET6笔试报名后可报考CET—SET6，</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">口语考生不得跨校报考。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">三、报名时间和方式</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">（一）网报时间。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">报名时间为</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">9月18日14∶00至9月28日17∶00，</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">相关科目报名安排如下：</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;">符合报考资格且英语四级尚未通过的学生，报名时间内可报考CET4。<span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">符合报考资格且英语六级未通过的学生，9月18日14∶00至9月27日9∶00优先报名CET6</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">；</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">9月27日9∶00后，六级笔试剩余考位面向符合报考资格的全部学生开放（含英语六级已通过学生），报满为止。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">（二）网报方式。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt;">考生自行登录全国大学英语四、六级考试报名网（</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">http://cet-bm.neea.edu.cn</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt;">），点击相应栏目进行报名，完成用户注册、查证报名资格、</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">个人信息确认</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt;">、选择报考科目、网上缴费等报名手续。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt;">考生报名前和报名过程中须认真阅读并充分了解网站首页的考生须知、报名流程、常见问题、特别提示、最新动态及省通告、学校通告等信息。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">逾期不接受补报名。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">（三）重要提醒。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">根据学校学生四六级考试报名现状，为给更多的本校学生提供考试机会，学校将一次性开放符合考试要求的全部考场。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; text-decoration: underline;">请各位有报考需求的学生，尤其是六级未通过的学生重视优先报考时间，及时进行网上报名。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">考位数满后及报名时间截止后，不再接受任何理由的补报名。本次报名后缺考的学生，下次考试将停考一次。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">四、考试收费</span></p><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 32.15pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">在校生笔试（含英语四级、六级以及日语、德语、俄语、法语四级）收费按照陕发改价格函</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">〔2025〕1575号文件规定执行，收费标准为每人每次30元。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">口试收费标准全国统一为每人每次50元。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">五、其他事项</span></p><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">（一）报名期间考生应仔细核对本人身份信息，本科生信息有误请咨询本科生院教务科，联系电话：81891206；研究生信息有误请咨询研究生院培养办公室，联系电话：81891312。</span></p><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">（二）成功完成口试报名的考生</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">于</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">11月17日</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">起登录报名系统</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">自行打印准考证。成功完成笔试报名的考生</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">于</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">12月1日</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">起登录报名系统</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">自行打印准考证</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;">。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="min-height: 16pt;">（三）</span><span style="font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">CET不再印发纸质成绩报告单。</span><span style="min-height: 16pt;">成绩发布10个工作日后，考生可登录中国教育考试网（</span></span><span style="font-size: 21px;">www.neea.edu.cn）<span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312;">查看并下载电子成绩报告单，电子成绩报告单与原纸质成绩报告单同等效力。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 16pt;"> </span><span style="font-size: 21px; text-indent: 0pt; min-height: 16pt;">（四）</span><span style="font-size: 21px; text-indent: 0pt; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">报名工作结束后，不再接受任何理由的补报名。</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; text-align: right;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">本科生院  </span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2026年9月14日</span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
